[{"title":"赠从妺婿张可大归泰和二首 其二","author":"胡直","text":"南归正逐雁南翔，暂度金陵返豫章。\n即看孤帆匡岳远，白云遥指更回肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31549,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题松赠李明府二绝 其一","author":"胡直","text":"翠巘临流矗镜中，万松倒挂碧巃嵷。\n主人衣白辞山出，应采龙形献帝宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31550,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题松赠李明府二绝 其二","author":"胡直","text":"虬飞夭矫樛枝劲，盖转扶疏曲干连。\n但识栋隆能柱国，讵知霜雪几经年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31551,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题况膳部扇景二绝 其一","author":"胡直","text":"平湖如练浸寒山，耐可乘槎碧汉间。\n几载钓鳌今已就，丝纶那用羡渔竿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31552,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题况膳部扇景二绝 其二","author":"胡直","text":"舟回林麓行犹系，月出湖心碎却圆。\n佳景当年游不极，更劳飞梦到江天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31553,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃源行四首 其一","author":"胡直","text":"断陇横冈苍雾屯，停骖为问古桃源。\n共言夜半传飞檄，正是当时花竹村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31554,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃源行四首 其二","author":"胡直","text":"腐草樛枝架短橧，傍床翁姥鬓鬙鬙。\n笯鸡瓮粟输租罄，纵到渔郎莫款承。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31555,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃源行四首 其三","author":"胡直","text":"秦代衣冠何处誇，蹊桃犹发晋时花。\n若论今日衣完肘，唯有桃川道士家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31556,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃源行四首 其四","author":"胡直","text":"饥媪扶藜诉乞怜，石壕悍吏索丁钱。\n撞开篱落声如豹，道是官家入觐年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31557,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过桃源洞再赋二首 其一","author":"胡直","text":"桃川道士路焚香，指点秦人古洞傍。\n引入高岩泉洒洒，倒看石壑驾飞梁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31558,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过桃源洞再赋二首 其二","author":"胡直","text":"北极宫前山似刀，苏黄渡口挂飞涛。\n峰攒壁绝深难到，应有秦人别种桃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31559,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蒲圻道上搴帷忽睹叠嶂连霄酷类敝庐前山感忆仲弟","author":"胡直","text":"共在天南水一乡，相看渺渺隔天长。\n搴帷忽见青冥嶂，指点还思唤二郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31560,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻雁忆两舍弟","author":"胡直","text":"翩翩好作一行飞，孤影怜余鬓欲稀。\n每忆高堂春酒熟，梦中齐著老莱衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31561,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过澧怀屈大夫","author":"胡直","text":"道可受兮不可传，虚以待之无为先。\n江潭若肯从渔父，芳芷幽兰应自妍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31562,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同蔡士备冲雨寻药山古刹叙别二绝 其一","author":"胡直","text":"松韵还同说偈时，峰头谁度笑声迟。\n我来不乞山僧法，莫拟重经李习之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31563,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同蔡士备冲雨寻药山古刹叙别二绝 其二","author":"胡直","text":"官程苦被白云牵，载酒寻山敞别筵。\n风雨莫怜分手地，衡庐已缔住山缘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31564,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观涨怀欧阳文朝","author":"胡直","text":"自怜济世本非才，鞅掌长依楚水隈。\n春到故园新涨满，昔时兰桨共谁回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31565,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夔府官舍梦王尚涵三首 其一","author":"胡直","text":"故人天上跨龙媒，旅夜翩然入梦来。\n万里愁闻夔子国，怜君遥度白盐堆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31566,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夔府官舍梦王尚涵三首 其二","author":"胡直","text":"少小交亲白发催，每从南国望金台。\n故人不厌关山隔，清梦还期夜夜来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31567,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夔府官舍梦王尚涵三首 其三","author":"胡直","text":"十二巫峰合沓新，为云为雨竟谁真。\n青春卧稳啼猿夜，不梦阳台梦故人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31568,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听莺怀邹继甫二绝 其一","author":"胡直","text":"莺声日日满幽林，宛转长唫复短唫。\n不见昔时同听客，啼莺空作昔时音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31569,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"度铁索桥","author":"胡直","text":"索桥宛似鹊填河，诘晓凌风蹑屩过。\n始信当年蹈水客，只凭忠信出洪波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31570,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七天桥","author":"胡直","text":"七天漭沆接虚无，六合浑沦见一吾。\n度后已知吾丧我，不须象罔索玄珠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31571,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天仙桥","author":"胡直","text":"乘风飞度万重云，亲受皇人赤玉文。\n为谢慇勤天上侣，先天已向语前闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31572,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山顶晚霁","author":"胡直","text":"八万山河一掌宽，四天应合作回阑。\n独怜到此谁为耦，坐共羲和倚日看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31573,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下至梅子坡大雨","author":"胡直","text":"非烟非雾烂银光，变作屯云雨欲狂。\n八部仙龙来顷刻，共留汗漫九天翔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31574,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蒙山丈从武阳驿放舟见忆春日同游奉答二首 其一","author":"胡直","text":"平羌江上放孤舟，想见峨眉影素秋。\n正是谪仙吟自好，那因相伴下渝洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31575,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蒙山丈从武阳驿放舟见忆春日同游奉答二首 其二","author":"胡直","text":"春日曾同听棹讴，青杨白舫共夷犹。\n秋来依旧峨眉月，独羡纶巾照白鸥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31576,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙亥春日效长庆心身问答三首 其一 心问身","author":"胡直","text":"心问身云何宴然，春晨啼鸟尚高眠。\n饶君安逸君知否，不遂公车已一年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31577,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙亥春日效长庆心身问答三首 其二 身答心","author":"胡直","text":"身答心云君莫誇，君今住处我为家。\n知君钝拙家常累，不遣家安总是差。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31578,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙亥春日效长庆心身问答三首 其三 心复答身","author":"胡直","text":"怜君傀儡不能收，专为抽牵岂自由。\n多少抽人随线断，谁从未断共君休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31579,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留别刘贡士汝弼","author":"魏观","text":"镏兄我知己，待我终不薄。\n荣辱由外来，相看一如昨。\n兹诚古人度，亦固君子学。\n明珠媚深渊，芳兰华幽壑。\n瑜然天地间，立志迥超卓。\n斯文论骨肉，缓急真可托。\n自我来水西，顾问每勤恪。\n报谢终未遑，夕息还早作。\n心驰迹拘缀，竟尔成阙略。\n苟以人事言，简慢深有怍。\n所恃惟久要，胸次多豁落。\n临风重沾衣，缄情送归鹤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31580,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃源县送颜以仁回鼎城","author":"魏观","text":"层阿递流云，繁树散初旭。\n之子送我来，我送之子复。\n既上辰州船，犹闻武陵曲。\n江空岁云暮，离思泫盈掬。\n征鸿落寒音，微波汎晴渌。\n悠悠负芳辰，耿耿企旸谷。\n临分致深情，炯若佩琼玉。\n人生重天伦，朋友非外属。\n渺予尚真率，虚伪悲世俗。\n采采湘浦兰，猗猗鼎城竹。\n行将往从之，一浣延览瞩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31581,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵吴子祥溪行有怀吾蒲而作 其一","author":"魏观","text":"绝似幽栖处，柴门瞰竹墟。\n未能忘志遂，且遣病眸舒。\n莼上邀黄耇，花前煮白鱼。\n近来儿侄辈，此乐定何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31582,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵吴子祥溪行有怀吾蒲而作 其二","author":"魏观","text":"岚光开翠崿，旭影动晴墟。\n送客莼边去，孤帆柳外舒。\n山云初度鹤，溪雨忽沈鱼。\n自得幽居趣，诸公恐未如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31583,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遂安舟中 其二","author":"魏观","text":"云碓波渰没，村船岸系高。\n树根悬野草，石罅散溪毛。\n到处幽怀适，都忘远涉劳。\n双飞怜白鸟，翠崿绕能遭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31584,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遂安舟中 其三","author":"魏观","text":"水分莼浦绿，山拥遂河流。\n有似双溪浒，重乘一叶舟。\n能诗惊后进，览俗景前修。\n今夕宜三友，清樽对月浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31585,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望庐山","author":"魏观","text":"峻极长相望，閒居好养恬。\n松巢思李白，菊径儗陶潜。\n秀色云千仞，秋光雨一帘。\n渔樵与麋鹿，于我定无嫌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31586,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄坡县感怀","author":"魏观","text":"狄人城边芳草多，君王立马高高坡。\n将军射雉城头上，回首天涯劳远望。\n湖又雨过泥水深，水深溪路嗟难寻。\n归来西陵日当午，惟有青山在樽俎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31587,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上","author":"魏观","text":"青山巃巃江雨湿，江上行舟追不及。\n七百里内风拗多，十三矶头水流急。\n平生不畏风涛惊，此行但觉能伤情。\n可缘世道险于此，无人揽辔思澄清。\n钧天洞庭渺何许，云际依稀见烟树。\n推篷正儗和渔歌，白鸟双飞过船去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31588,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠襄阳杨守将","author":"魏观","text":"曾扈銮舆上玉京，更持武节定西兵。\n绣裳日射麒麟阁，玉帐云寒骠骑营。\n竹树晴烟浮楚甸，柳花春雨隔樊城。\n群儿拍手襄阳道，应为将军播颂声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31589,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"襄阳赵太守","author":"魏观","text":"下车人说使君明，书罢黄堂逸兴生。\n鸟度春阴归汉甸，江含云影护襄城。\n竹间题壁知僧姓，花下看碑识吏情。\n圣代民和推妙选，御屏高处列芳名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31590,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"避地莼滨偶成","author":"魏观","text":"云扉俯瞰莼湖滨，风景迥隔蕲阳尘。\n青虫悬丝不到地，黄鸟蹴花时近人。\n酒为得欢当乐饮，客虽非伴且相亲。\n朝来群小诧吾舅，二老至今仍皂巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31591,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"离寿昌县","author":"魏观","text":"溪上徐徐上小舟，满前风物眩吟眸。\n鸟回曲径冲花落，浪激层滩触石流。\n贯网有鱼供午馔，罄瓶无酒破春愁。\n沿洄处处嘉山水，恰似吾蒲旧日游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31592,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"复用前韵答汪汇掾郎","author":"魏观","text":"沙头白叟送行舟，舟上青山豁病眸。\n一苇载云归晚溆，百花吹雨入春流。\n情深湘瑟方凝梦，声婉吴歌复送愁。\n赖有良朋解知己，不时呼酒话同游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31593,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留题明因寺","author":"魏观","text":"石磴迢迢带夕曛，松房初启妙香焚。\n窗前峭壁悬青雨，屋上流泉绕白云。\n山翠湿衣僧未觉，岩花落帽客先闻。\n田家见说来修祀，铃磬宣经至夜分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31594,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿昌道中","author":"魏观","text":"野寺吟诗兴未阑，徐徐骢马出松关。\n村原窈窕通幽径，林壑依稀似故山。\n鸥泛晓溪云碓静，犊眠春陇雨犁閒。\n田家老稚相迎望，应笑征夫两鬓斑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31595,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题遂安童氏清远池亭二首 其一","author":"魏观","text":"风轩月榭迥无尘，池上新亭更可人。\n数点落花青嶂雨，四时流水碧桃春。\n石梁把钓儿嬉惯，山径携诗客过频。\n世道只今优暇少，偶然琴鹤且相亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31596,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题遂安童氏清远池亭二首 其二","author":"魏观","text":"迢递山行喜见君，留连清远意殊勤。\n松扉近挹桥边翠，花岛平分水上云。\n入馔白鱼双尾出，隔窗黄鸟数声闻。\n碧崖却忆莼溪上，竹月山泉慰夕昕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31597,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵遂安诸生洪诜","author":"魏观","text":"彼美诸生偶见亲，芙蓉秋水夐无尘。\n气分金紫三峰秀，诗发琴清五柳春。\n咏月花前鹃到耳，看云松下鹤随身。\n老来才力嗟迟暮，爱尔书香不乏人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31598,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈秀才宪","author":"魏观","text":"器识曾为远大期，论交犹愧奖成迟。\n池塘屡梦生春草，林壑应怀种紫芝。\n夜月绕残乌鹊树，春山啼老杜鹃枝。\n江头烂熳梅花发，把酒怜君惜别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31599,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟发金沙","author":"魏观","text":"风波渺渺雪漫漫，千里扬帆意自安。\n渔父一蓑江上见，剡溪双棹画中看。\n花融金帐歌喉暖，月过柴门卧榻寒。\n明日洞庭开霁色，买鱼沽酒且追欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31600,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣子槃往华容族间种田寄安卿章士明","author":"魏观","text":"樽酒西郊慰远还，梅花春意正相关。\n幽栖只好山林下，至乐无如畎亩间。\n为说柴桑三径在，肯容莘野一犁閒。\n斯文更有殷勤祝，烱烱明珠照二鬟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31601,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄都昌胡君茂处士","author":"魏观","text":"东汇清川接翠峦，故人茅屋此中安。\n元龙湖海藏胸次，司马江山绕笔端。\n几树落花春送雨，一帘飞瀑暮生寒。\n扁舟儗欲寻君去，千里烟波路渺漫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31602,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖口子槃家春别归","author":"魏观","text":"儿女还家我谪官，远行容易别离难。\n家分异舫方为别，泪满征衣不忍看。\n江汉烟波秋欲暮，湓湖风雨晓初寒。\n小孙最是关情处，顿足呼爷语更酸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31603,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南康阻风","author":"魏观","text":"两日风涛阻客舟，山城邂逅散离忧。\n松枝趁市逢樵隐，蓬鬓携家愧宦游。\n天际五峰仍耐老，云间双剑欲横秋。\n匡庐许我巢松去，咫尺攀缘到上头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31604,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白雪山","author":"魏观","text":"清梦悠悠绕故林，书窗皎皎白云深。\n法曹千里动归思，处士十年留野心。\n石砚昼封涵雨润，岩扉朝度带松阴。\n何当劝尽杯中物，副我还山旧日阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31605,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"筠艭","author":"魏观","text":"淇澳茅庐仅一间，宛如乘棹竹溪湾。\n芙蓉秋水三千顷，翠黛春风十二鬟。\n凤管制来遗谱在，渔竿归去钓丝閒。\n湘滨已有沿洄约，六逸清风信可攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31606,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春","author":"魏观","text":"莺啭听来丸药好，客陪欢处□樽开。\n清烟晚树深连竹，细雨春花乱点苔。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31607,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"豫章南阁临眺","author":"汪广洋","text":"章江澄夕景，杞树集凉飔。\n叠阁连云起，凝笳带月悲。\n因兹怀旧感，登览独移时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31608,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赣城水东","author":"汪广洋","text":"烟屿水花净，风潭云树齐。\n倒藤悬宿鸟，绝壁挂晴霓。\n岑寂坐忘返，空冥思欲迷。\n尘缨如可浣，予亦赋幽栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31609,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨白花","author":"汪广洋","text":"杨白花尔何白荡，漾春心易南北美。\n人深宫愁捧心击，碎珊瑚为谁惜大。\n江东流，烟雾深，欲往从之思如织。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31610,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞下曲","author":"周玄","text":"草檄驰高阙，分符出未央。\n雕弓秋玉镂，宝剑夜金装。\n马饮长河白，兵交落日黄。\n军中诸校喜，生得左贤王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31611,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题山水画寄筠州王校文","author":"周玄","text":"六奇秀南州，五老萃西路。\n风壤虽异区，英灵总佳誉。\n千回边海日，百丈际江树。\n苍翠春到时，空濛鸟飞处。\n沾衣萝磴雨，宿棹花岩雾。\n适楚偶目新，瞻闽屡怀故。\n雅澹浩然想，解道玄晖句。\n慰尔远暌离，因之裂纨素。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31612,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得宿猿洞送友人之湘中","author":"周玄","text":"怪石如云起天上，枯藤盘根垂百丈。\n萝深苔滑鸟不栖，索漠寒猿卧相向。\n两两三三往复回，衔花映水皆奇状。\n清秋倒树风涧号，初日排云雪岩壮。\n醉客应为巫峡吟，行人厌作巴山望。\n洞里愁声谁忍闻，别时对此堪惆怅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31613,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得函谷关送贾一","author":"周玄","text":"西望长安怆别颜，荒城迢递白云间。\n行人恶听河声险，旧路长连草色閒。\n树里月来通汉苑，天边云霁傍秦山。\n凭君如见关门尹，为问青牛几日还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31614,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈大宅挟弹图","author":"周玄","text":"鸣弓日晚骋霜蹄，灞上飞花踏作泥。\n辛苦塞垣多少恨，五陵春色醉中迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31615,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芦雁词","author":"周玄","text":"田食不厌肥，沙宿不厌广。\n天长洲渚静，露下蒹葭响。\n关河屡超忽，寒暑互来往。\n南翔先雪过，北翼迎春返。\n预愁远道苦，岂暇高丘想。\n同类聊自持，分飞恐矰网。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31616,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行路难","author":"周玄","text":"长安行路难，上阙隘秦关。\n万里貂裘敝，三边宝剑閒。\n近闻绛灌在，翻谪贾生还。\n归去狂歌客，萧条草莽间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31617,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]